t\u2019s show them how,"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "We\u2019ll make all the crowds dance and sway,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "With our pop full of laughter and play."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}